        {
            "title": "比特幣逼近65,000美元，基礎設施安全風險升溫",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"比特幣逼近65,000美元，基礎設施安全風險升溫\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/07290cf5d0d78311f4fc7eee1f36e28b487c9ed89e9e64d92a2dd72c107dfeef/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fi-invdn-com.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPED8B0RG_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">比特幣逼近65,000美元，基礎設施安全風險升溫</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 週六，比特幣交易價格略低於65,000美元，較前24小時小幅上漲。與此同時，投資者正密切關注BTCPay Server爆出的重大安全漏洞，以及BIP-110鏈式股份拆細可能引發重放攻擊的潛在風險。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">攻擊者於週五深夜利用BTCPay Server的安全漏洞，竊取了用於控制Lightning節點的憑證。這些節點運行LND軟件，專門處理快速、低成本的比特幣支付。截至美國東部時間上午4:54（北京時間16:54），比特幣上漲0.61%，報64,986.0美元。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-99c4fcff-603a-3b1c-b950-d57f8f3abc08-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">BTCPay官方確認資金已遭竊取，並緊急要求受影響的運營商立即更新至2.4.2版本，或將伺服器下線。目前，項目方尚未披露受害者數量及損失的比特幣金額。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[92px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[92px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:h-[120px] lg:w-[calc(50%-16px)]\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次漏洞允許未經身份驗證的攻擊者獲取「macaroon」文件——即訪問LND節點的憑證文件。攻擊者一旦取得這些文件，便可控制Lightning錢包、關閉支付通道並轉移資金。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">硬件錢包製造商Foundation表示，攻擊者已清空其BTCPay Lightning節點，但未能觸及其鏈上熱錢包。比特幣媒體Citadel21亦報告其Lightning節點遭受資金損失。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在BTCPay內生成的標準鏈上錢包並未受到影響。然而，存放於LND節點鏈上錢包的資金仍可能面臨風險。預計在運營商完成補丁安裝後，事件的詳細報告將會公佈。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此外，比特幣持有者還面臨來自擬議中的BIP-110分叉的另一重風險。該分叉可能於本週末在第961,632個區塊附近啟動，提案旨在暫時限制比特幣交易中存儲的非支付數據。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">週五，礦工的信號支持率僅約2.6%，遠低於提案所需的55%門檻。然而，運行BIP-110軟件的電腦一旦達到激活高度，便會自動拒絕未發出信號的區塊，從而可能形成少數派鏈。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">若發生鏈式股份拆細，持有者在兩條鏈上的餘額初期將相等。出售分叉幣可能使真實BTC面臨重放攻擊風險，因為同一筆已簽名的交易在兩個網絡上均可能有效。開發者Kevin Loaec建議無法分離餘額的持有者暫時不要動用相關資產。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另一方面，XRP Ledger 3.3.0版本提議為機構代幣化資產引入保密轉賬功能。該功能將對餘額及支付金額進行加密，同時允許發行方、核數師及監管機構選擇性地獲取相關信息。此功能需獲得80%驗證者連續兩週的支持方可激活。</p><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>今日加密貨幣價格：多數山寨幣跟隨比特幣上漲</strong></h2><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">從更廣泛的加密貨幣市場來看，週六多數山寨幣跟隨比特幣走高。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">全球市值第二的加密貨幣<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"以太幣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:以太幣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/ethereum/eth-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">以太幣</a>上漲0.32%，報1,916.82美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"XRP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:XRP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/xrp/xrp-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">XRP</a>上漲0.41%，報1.0353美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Solana\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Solana;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/solana/sol-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Solana</a>本交易日上漲2.16%，報74.78美元。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"Cardano\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:Cardano;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/cardano/ada-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Cardano</a>則表現分化，最新跌幅為0.55%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在迷因幣方面，<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"狗狗幣\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:狗狗幣;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/dogecoin/doge-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">狗狗幣</a>上漲1.44%，而<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"$TRUMP\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:$TRUMP;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/crypto/official-trump/trumpo-usd?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">$TRUMP</a>當日則基本持平。</p></div>",
